OL,3,AArmed police swoop as man, 61, arrested
OL,4,Afor murder and woman in car crash dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 61-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a woman who
OL,8,Fcrashed her car died.
OL,10,FSouth Wales Police said the woman, 47,
OL,11,Ffrom North Cornelly, Bridgend, crashed
OL,12,Finto a wall on Coity Road at about
OL,13,F12:43 BST on Monday.
OL,15,FBut the force said she had suffered
OL,16,Finjuries "unrelated" to the crash.
OL,18,FIt followed armed police swooping on a
OL,19,Fnearby sheltered housing retirement
OL,20,Fcomplex, Ger-y-Nant, where the man was
OL,21,Farrested.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
